# BLOODLETTER

{{note,large,classDetails
**Key Stats:** STR, INT   **Hit Die:** 1d10   **Starting HP:** 17
:
**Saves:** STR+, DEX-   **Armor:** Leather   **Weapons:** Blades
:
**Starting Gear:** Handaxe, Cheap Hide, Saw
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 1
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Open Vein.** At the start of your turn, you may choose one:
<div style="margin-left:16px;">

- Pay up to 2xSTR HP to deal additional damage with your melee attacks equal to the amount of life paid until the end of your turn. 
- (2/encounter) Heal 2xINT HP.


</div>

**Medical History.** You gain Advantage on Examination checks involving dead or Bloodied creatures.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 2
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Branded.** When you hit a target with an Open Vein enhanced attack, they become Branded. You must have paid at least STR HP for Open Vein to apply Branded. Branded persists until the encounter ends.
:
**Exploit.** (Reach: 4) Action: Remove Branded from a target to Daze them until the end of their next turn.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 3
     Subclass
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass.** Choose a Bloodletter subclass.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 4
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Crimson Rites.** Learn the _Blood Price_ Crimson Rite, as well as 1 more of your choice.
:
**Key Stat Increase.** +1 STR or INT.
}}



<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 5
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Visceral Toll.** (1/encounter) You may gain a Wound instead of paying a Rite’s HP cost.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase.** +1 DEX or WIL.
}}

{{note,wide
_**Anatomical Study.** When you study the cardiovascular system during a Safe Rest, you may choose different Bloodletter options._
}}

{{pageNumber}}

\page

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 6
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Open Vein (2).** Open Vein’s maximum cost is now 3xSTR. Open Vein’s healing is now 3xINT and it can be used 3/encounter.
:
**Crimson Rites (2).** Choose 1 Crimson Rite to learn.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 7
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass.** Gain your Bloodletter subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 8
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Reckoning.** Your attacks deal additional damage equal to your current Wounds.
:
**Crimson Rites (3).** Choose 1 Crimson Rite to learn.
:
**Key Stat Increase.** +1 STR or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 9
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Open Vein (3).** Open Vein’s maximum cost is now 4xSTR. Open Vein’s healing is now 4xINT.
:
**Lingering Vitals.** Whenever you use a Rite, gain LVL temp HP.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase.** +1 DEX or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 10
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Crimson Rites (4).** Choose 1 Crimson Rite to learn.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 11
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
