:
**Key Stat Increase.** +1 STR or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 13
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Blood Trail.** You always know the location of any Branded creature, and they cannot be invisible to you.
:
**Open Vein (4).** Open Vein’s maximum cost is now 5xSTR. Open Vein’s healing is now 5xINT and it can be used 4/encounter.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase.** +1 DEX or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 14
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Crimson Rites (6).** Choose 1 Crimson Rite to learn.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 15
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass.** Gain your Bloodletter subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 16
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Crimson Rites (7).** Choose 1 Crimson Rite to learn.
:
**Key Stat Increase.** +1 STR or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 17
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Open Vein (5).** Open Vein’s maximum cost is now 6xSTR. Open Vein’s healing is now 6xINT.
:
**Overdraw.** If a Rite’s HP cost would drop you to 0 HP, you instead drop to 1 HP.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase.** +1 DEX or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 18
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Reckoning (2).** Your weapon attacks deal additional damage equal to twice your current Wounds.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 19
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Epic Boon.** Choose an Epic Boon (see pg. 23 of the GM's Guide).
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 20
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Last Reserves.** +1 to any 2 of your stats. (1/Safe Rest) If you would gain your final Wound, regain half of your max HP instead.
}}

